<%- include("partials/header",{title:"Home",player:sessionPlayer}) %>
<section class="mapleHero homeV2Hero"><div class="mapleHeroBg" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mapleHeroShade" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mapleHeroCharacters" aria-hidden="true"><img class="left" src="/assets/hero-left.webp" alt=""><img class="right" src="/assets/hero-right.webp" alt=""></div><div class="wrap mapleHeroInner"><div class="mapleHeroCopy"><div class="mapleHeroTag">WELCOME BACK TO MAPLE WORLD</div><img class="heroBrand" src="/assets/everleaf-remaster.svg" alt="EverLeaf Enhanced Classic"><h1>Classic Maple,<em>grown with care.</em></h1><p>EverLeaf keeps the familiar v83 adventure at its core, then improves the road around it: thoughtful quality-of-life, fair progression, launcher-managed updates, community development, and a world designed to last.</p><div class="mapleHeroActions"><a class="btn primary" href="<%=sessionPlayer?'/downloads':'/register'%>"><%=sessionPlayer?'PLAY EVERLEAF':'START YOUR JOURNEY'%></a><a class="btn" href="/downloads">GET THE LAUNCHER</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/about">WORLD GUIDE</a></div><div class="mapleHeroFacts"><span>Enhanced Classic v83</span><span>No mandatory HP washing</span><span>No pay-to-win advantage</span><span>20 channels</span></div></div><aside class="mapleLive homeV2Status"><div class="mapleLiveHead"><strong>EverLeaf World</strong><span><%=status.online?'Open for adventure':'Currently unavailable'%></span></div><div class="mapleLiveGrid"><div class="mapleLiveMetric"><small>Server</small><strong id="live-status" class="<%=status.online?'online':''%>"><%=status.online?'ONLINE':'OFFLINE'%></strong></div><div class="mapleLiveMetric"><small>Players</small><strong id="live-players"><%=players===null?'—':players%></strong></div><div class="mapleLiveMetric"><small>Channels</small><strong id="live-channels" class="gold"><%=status.channels%>/<%=status.totalChannels%></strong></div><div class="mapleLiveMetric"><small>Client</small><strong><%=brand.version%></strong></div></div><div class="mapleLiveFoot">Live status is read from the existing EverLeaf server integration.</div></aside></div></section>
<nav class="mapleQuick" aria-label="EverLeaf quick links"><div class="wrap"><a href="/downloads"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">↓</b><span><strong>Download</strong><small>Launcher & client</small></span></a><a href="/rankings"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">#</b><span><strong>Rankings</strong><small>Top adventurers</small></span></a><a href="/news"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">N</b><span><strong>World Journal</strong><small>Patches & events</small></span></a><a href="<%=brand.discordUrl%>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">C</b><span><strong>Community</strong><small>Guilds & Discord</small></span></a><a href="<%=sessionPlayer?'/account':'/login'%>"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">@</b><span><strong><%=sessionPlayer?'My Account':'Account'%></strong><small><%=sessionPlayer?'Characters & settings':'Login or register'%></small></span></a></div></nav>
<section class="mapleHomeBody"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionHead"><div><div class="pageEyebrow">EVERLEAF HANDBOOK</div><h2>Old-school foundations. Better long-term play.</h2></div><a href="/about">EXPLORE THE WORLD →</a></div><div class="mapleIntro homeFeatureGrid"><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/about"><b>v83</b><h3>Enhanced Classic</h3><p>Familiar classes, maps, bosses, quests, items, and progression remain recognizable while carefully chosen systems make the journey smoother.</p></a><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/downloads"><b>QOL</b><h3>Modern Client Experience</h3><p>The EverLeaf launcher installs, verifies, repairs, updates, and starts your client so players do not have to maintain files by hand.</p></a><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/rules"><b>FAIR</b><h3>Play Comes First</h3><p>No pay-to-win advantage and no mandatory HP washing. Your character grows through the game, not through a checkout screen.</p></a></div>
<div class="mapleHomeColumns"><section><div class="sectionHead"><div><div class="pageEyebrow">WORLD JOURNAL</div><h2>Latest from EverLeaf</h2></div><a href="/news">ALL NEWS →</a></div><div class="mapleNewsGrid"><% const newsImages=['/assets/news-welcome.webp','/assets/news-event.webp','/assets/news-patch.webp']; %><% posts.slice(0,3).forEach((p,i)=>{ %><a class="newsStory" href="/news/<%=p.slug%>"><img src="<%=newsImages[i%newsImages.length]%>" alt=""><div class="newsStoryBody"><div class="newsStoryMeta"><span class="kicker"><%=p.type%></span><span><%=String(p.created_at).slice(0,10)%></span></div><h3><%=p.title%></h3><p><%=p.excerpt%></p><strong>Read journal entry →</strong></div></a><% }) %><% if(!posts.length){ %><div class="newsStory"><img src="/assets/news-welcome.webp" alt=""><div class="newsStoryBody"><span class="kicker">WORLD NEWS</span><h3>Welcome to EverLeaf</h3><p>Server news, patch notes, events, and maintenance notices will appear here.</p></div></div><% } %></div></section><aside><div class="mapleRank"><div class="mapleRankHead"><div class="pageEyebrow">HALL OF LEGENDS</div><h2>Top Adventurers</h2></div><% (topCharacters||[]).slice(0,7).forEach((r,i)=>{ %><div class="mapleRankRow"><span class="mapleRankNo"><%=i+1%></span><span><strong><%=r.name%></strong><% if(r.jobName){ %><small><%=r.jobName%></small><% } %></span><strong class="rankLv">Lv. <%=r.level%></strong></div><% }) %><% if(!(topCharacters||[]).length){ %><div class="mapleRankRow"><span class="mapleRankNo">1</span><span><strong>Rankings coming soon</strong></span><strong class="rankLv">—</strong></div><% } %><div style="padding:14px"><a class="btn" href="/rankings" style="width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:center">VIEW FULL RANKINGS</a></div></div></aside></div>
<div class="mapleCta homeCta"><div><span class="kicker">BEGINNER'S PATH</span><h2>Your next adventure starts here.</h2><p>Create your account, install through the launcher, and enter Maple World with the community.</p></div><div class="mapleCtaActions"><a class="btn primary" href="<%=sessionPlayer?'/downloads':'/register'%>"><%=sessionPlayer?'DOWNLOAD LAUNCHER':'CREATE ACCOUNT'%></a><a class="btn" href="/help">PLAYER HELP</a></div></div></div></section>
<script src="/js/home-status.js" defer></script><%- include("partials/footer") %>
